Subject: [PATCH 2/6] fix(stock): fit-to-models and the stock strip measure the
 parts, never the fixtures

The Stock page's Fit to Models (box, cylinder, per-side) and its
"Models:" readout read setup_align::solid_aabb_in, which walks every
model - vises, accessories, plates and tagged fixtures included - so a
fitted stock grew around the vise. The fit now lives in
camcraft_app::stock_fit: part_bounds (the #1529 part_aabb_in set), a
parts-only radius twin for the snug cylinder, and fit_command, the one
undoable SetStock both the GUI and a new MCP tool fit_stock run.
Collision checks are unchanged.

Fixes #1538

